WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:03.183
Point at the problem, and let a coding agent fix it.

00:03.633 --> 00:06.698
Hold Alt, click an element, and describe the change.

00:22.273 --> 00:25.570
The Pi coding agent takes the annotation and edits your source.

00:28.953 --> 00:31.786
The fix is on the page, without a full reload.
